      "body": "## Purpose\r\n\r\nFixes #56263. `DeepSeekV3ToolParser.extract_tool_calls` truncated content at the tool-calls block and never resumed, while `extract_tool_calls_streaming` emits the trailing text as content deltas. The parser disagreed with its own streaming mode, and non-streaming `/v1/messages` silently lost the trailing text. Content now spans the text before and after the tool-calls block. Hermes has the same truncation pattern (`hermes_tool_parser.py:109`) and is left for a separate discussion.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\n.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/tool_parsers/test_deepseekv3_tool_parser.py -v\r\n\r\n## Test Result\r\n\r\nNew regression test `test_post_tool_call_text_kept_in_both_modes` fails without the fix and passes with it; full parser suite: 17 passed, 1 xfailed.",
